WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.799
<i>An unknown frontier</i>

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>On the map painted by my heart</i>

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:59.142
<i>When I open the door, the path goes on</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:05.107
<i>I'm kicking up dust as I</i>
<i>start running to your town</i>

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:11.822
<i>Along a route where earth and sky meet</i>

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:15.576
<i>Riding the rushing southern wind</i>

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:18.495
<i>Slicing through the wind</i>
<i>dyed blue by the sky</i>

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:25.627
<i>I'm rushing out with my whole heart</i>

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.131
<i>Shooting past the midday moon</i>

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.259
<i>Towards a world different</i>
<i>from what we've known before</i>

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:36.096
<i>I will keep on running through to the end</i>

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.681
<i>However far</i>

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:41.602
<i>Just like that wind</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.899
<i>Just like that wind</i>

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.762
Chidori...

00:02:20.015 --> 00:02:21.350
Chidori is...

00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:27.856
dead.

00:02:59.721 --> 00:03:04.017
Sousuke. Sorry, but we followed you.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:06.270
Mao and the others are
in combat with the Venom,

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.522
without even having
any decent countermeasures.

00:03:08.522 --> 00:03:11.233
We just relayed our coordinates
to the de Danaan.

00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:15.237
They are going to be deploying the
Arbalest to this location immediately.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.616
Please, go!

00:03:19.616 --> 00:03:23.787
You of all people should know we
have no chance of winning like this!

00:03:23.787 --> 00:03:26.456
She's dead.

00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:29.251
It's his curse.

00:03:29.251 --> 00:03:34.840
I let Chidori die. He made me kill him.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.967
What's left for me now?

00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:38.719
Kaname is?

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:43.348
I never had a future to begin with.

00:03:43.348 --> 00:03:44.808
You can all go ahead and kill
each other for all I care.

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:46.852
Go ahead and die for all I care.

00:03:49.271 --> 00:03:52.774
Humans are nothing but chunks of meat.

00:03:53.901 --> 00:03:56.403
Do you seriously think that?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:01.992
You sound just like those terrorists!

00:04:01.992 --> 00:04:04.244
Do you understand that?

00:04:06.997 --> 00:04:09.166
I see.

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:13.337
Then you aren't one of us anymore.

00:04:13.337 --> 00:04:14.546
Corporal!

00:04:14.546 --> 00:04:17.841
A soldier who's lost his soul
is nothing but a killer.

00:04:17.841 --> 00:04:19.968
We cannot leave him behind here.

00:04:19.968 --> 00:04:22.012
You don't understand a thing.

00:04:22.012 --> 00:04:23.263
Oh yes I do.

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:24.973
Do you?

00:04:48.956 --> 00:04:50.415
Hideous.

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:55.671
It was useless to send this thing.

00:04:55.671 --> 00:04:58.090
I can't even use it anyway.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.008
I don't<i> want </i>to, either.

00:05:04.721 --> 00:05:08.016
That's right. Just stay there and rust away.

00:05:11.478 --> 00:05:13.480
Where do you think you're going?

00:05:14.857 --> 00:05:17.693
I'm asking you,
where do you think you're going?

00:05:17.693 --> 00:05:18.652
Huh?

00:05:18.652 --> 00:05:20.612
Don't give me that "Huh?"!

00:05:20.612 --> 00:05:22.531
Chido... ri?

00:05:22.531 --> 00:05:24.741
"Ri" isn't right, either!

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:27.077
You're... alive?

00:05:31.373 --> 00:05:32.040
Wha--?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.543
"Wha" isn't right, either!

00:05:34.543 --> 00:05:38.380
I went through a hell of a time
just to get here!

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:39.673
Up until just a second ago,

00:05:39.673 --> 00:05:44.386
I was ready and willing to
jump into your arms all dramatic-like,

00:05:44.386 --> 00:05:45.971
but what's this all about?

00:05:45.971 --> 00:05:47.097
"You're... alive?"

00:05:47.097 --> 00:05:48.015
<i>That's </i>what you have to say?

00:05:48.015 --> 00:05:51.143
You<i> so </i>pissed me off!
You completely ruined the moment!

00:05:51.143 --> 00:05:52.769
So what are you going to do about it?

00:05:52.769 --> 00:05:55.981
How are you going to take
responsibility for this? Huh?

00:05:55.981 --> 00:05:59.443
--W-Wait Chidori, I don't understand what you're...
--Shut it!

00:06:00.527 --> 00:06:02.529
Does it hurt? It does, doesn't it?

00:06:02.529 --> 00:06:04.281
That's the pain in my heart!

00:06:04.281 --> 00:06:06.116
And<i> this</i>...

00:06:06.992 --> 00:06:08.744
is the pain in my body!

00:06:08.744 --> 00:06:10.621
And...

00:06:10.621 --> 00:06:14.124
this is the pain in my soul!

00:06:20.964 --> 00:06:21.632
It's a monster.

00:06:21.632 --> 00:06:23.509
Did you just say something?

00:06:23.509 --> 00:06:26.386
Wh-What in the world is going on?

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:29.473
Do you even need to ask?
I've come to bring you back with me!

00:06:29.473 --> 00:06:32.142
I almost died, then I thought
about a lot of things,

00:06:32.142 --> 00:06:34.603
then I decided to come out and tell you!

00:06:34.603 --> 00:06:37.105
In other words, I...

00:06:42.528 --> 00:06:46.406
I, umm...

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:47.366
You what?

00:06:47.366 --> 00:06:54.706
Like I was saying... I... Umm...

00:07:04.967 --> 00:07:08.428
It's because I'm the class rep!

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:09.513
Huh?

00:07:11.181 --> 00:07:14.852
I guess determination
fades after a day goes by...

00:07:14.852 --> 00:07:16.019
So, what did you want to say?

00:07:16.019 --> 00:07:18.146
Just forget it!

00:07:18.146 --> 00:07:20.190
I heard from this old guy named Hunter!

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:22.359
Mao and the others are fighting, right?

00:07:22.359 --> 00:07:24.528
So then what are you doing<i> here</i>?

00:07:29.324 --> 00:07:31.034
But I...

00:07:31.034 --> 00:07:32.286
What?

00:07:32.286 --> 00:07:35.581
I can't operate that machine anymore.

00:07:35.581 --> 00:07:38.083
Not only that...

00:07:40.544 --> 00:07:42.713
I even deserted you...

00:07:43.797 --> 00:07:45.716
Is that why you can't find your strength?

00:07:45.716 --> 00:07:46.884
I don't know.

00:07:46.884 --> 00:07:49.178
Are you saying you feel like
throwing everything away?

00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:50.512
I just don't know!

00:07:50.512 --> 00:07:52.890
I understand.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.187
You got worn out, right?
But you couldn't tell anyone, right?

00:07:58.187 --> 00:08:01.565
Your work ethic is really strong
and your will is weak, so...

00:08:01.565 --> 00:08:04.234
It got to the point you just
couldn't do anything anymore, right?

00:08:04.234 --> 00:08:07.070
Me? No, I...

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.198
Worthless man.

00:08:09.198 --> 00:08:10.657
Coward.

00:08:10.657 --> 00:08:12.910
Good for nothing. Weakling.

00:08:15.078 --> 00:08:18.874
But you're strong. Incredibly kind.

00:08:18.874 --> 00:08:22.586
You're useless, but you
manage to get things done.

00:08:22.586 --> 00:08:25.088
At least, that's the kind
of guy I thought you were.

00:08:25.088 --> 00:08:25.964
Huh?

00:08:25.964 --> 00:08:29.259
<i>The weak are parasites of the strong.</i>

00:08:29.259 --> 00:08:30.928
I...

00:08:30.928 --> 00:08:34.765
<i>Do you really enjoy being</i>
<i>with a bunch of weaklings?</i>

00:08:34.765 --> 00:08:36.683
I'm a worthless man?

00:08:36.683 --> 00:08:39.937
Well, aren't you?

00:09:26.525 --> 00:09:28.277
Sorry, Chidori, I...

00:09:29.987 --> 00:09:30.821
Wha-What...

00:09:30.821 --> 00:09:31.989
Just shut up!

00:09:31.989 --> 00:09:34.658
Everyone's in danger, right?
And what about your class credits?

00:09:34.658 --> 00:09:36.577
Get moving, right now!

00:09:36.577 --> 00:09:38.579
Get this over with!

00:09:48.672 --> 00:09:50.382
Perth 1 to Uruz 1.

00:09:50.382 --> 00:09:53.010
Fall back three blocks to the south.
Lure him there somehow.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.011
Roger.

00:09:54.761 --> 00:09:56.680
The enemy must be tired too.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.682
As long as we can hold out, we'll win this.

00:09:58.682 --> 00:10:00.684
That's<i> if </i>we can hold out.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:15.991
Shit!

00:10:18.911 --> 00:10:21.747
Don't cause me...

00:10:21.747 --> 00:10:24.166
any trouble...

00:10:29.713 --> 00:10:32.341
Uruz 1 to Perth 1.

00:10:32.341 --> 00:10:34.384
This is Perth 1. What is it?

00:10:34.384 --> 00:10:35.886
Venoms sighted...

00:10:40.182 --> 00:10:41.934
Five of them.

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:48.690
We finally meet again, my little Yu Fang.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:52.236
Going berserk in an unplanned area
just because you feel like it...

00:10:52.236 --> 00:10:54.279
What do you think you're doing?

00:10:54.279 --> 00:10:57.533
When causing a war,
you have to stick to the plan.

00:10:57.533 --> 00:11:00.619
This is a no-no!

00:11:00.619 --> 00:11:02.913
So...

00:11:02.913 --> 00:11:06.792
I<i> really </i>don't appreciate
your doing things like this!

00:11:06.792 --> 00:11:08.085
Then I'm glad I did it.

00:11:08.085 --> 00:11:09.086
Huh?

00:11:09.086 --> 00:11:14.299
I heard that Amalgam caused the civil war
that destroyed our hometown.

00:11:14.299 --> 00:11:16.802
If we can get our revenge on you,

00:11:16.802 --> 00:11:18.887
then my sister and I will
have achieved our goal.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:22.349
Your sister, huh?

00:11:22.349 --> 00:11:26.687
Oh yeah, that's right!
We have a special guest!

00:11:26.687 --> 00:11:29.815
Time for you to meet her!

00:11:33.986 --> 00:11:36.697
Yes, it's your little sister!

00:11:36.697 --> 00:11:39.324
I brought her here especially for you!

00:11:39.324 --> 00:11:41.660
But she doesn't seem to be
doing too well, does she?

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:46.039
Hey! Yu Lan! I wonder what's wrong?

00:11:46.039 --> 00:11:50.460
"Ewer since I got cawt
by the stwong, sexy Mister Gates,

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.588
I've been so depwessed."

00:11:52.588 --> 00:11:58.760
"But I'm so happy!
I got to see my big shister!"

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:02.306
Oh, I see. I'm so happy for you.

00:12:03.891 --> 00:12:09.313
"Hey Big Shis, stop fighting!
No good comes out of war!"

00:12:09.313 --> 00:12:13.066
"And besides, I'm so in wuv
with Mister Gates!"

00:12:14.818 --> 00:12:16.778
Oops, sorry, looks like it broke.

00:12:16.778 --> 00:12:18.947
You bastard!

00:12:37.799 --> 00:12:39.927
You're such an amateur!

00:12:45.807 --> 00:12:48.519
Off you go, now!

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.282
Ahh, that felt good.

00:13:02.282 --> 00:13:04.535
Now then, you over there.

00:13:04.535 --> 00:13:06.537
You're a soldier from Mithril, right?

00:13:06.537 --> 00:13:09.873
I originally didn't have any
business with you today, but...

00:13:09.873 --> 00:13:12.042
Oh well, I guess it's just
not your lucky day.

00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:13.210
Ben! Run!

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:15.462
Stay away! You won't make it in time!

00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:20.300
Okay, my poor little sheep,
have you finished saying your prayers?

00:13:21.468 --> 00:13:24.930
Well then, have a nice day!

00:13:31.478 --> 00:13:32.813
What?

00:13:32.813 --> 00:13:34.731
Who fired? Was that you, Weber?

00:13:34.731 --> 00:13:36.775
Nope, it wasn't me.

00:13:36.775 --> 00:13:40.320
But it looks like<i> he </i>has finally
decided to grace us with his presence.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:43.115
And just in time, too!

00:13:43.115 --> 00:13:45.826
Isn't this just a little too perfect, now?

00:13:45.826 --> 00:13:47.911
It would seem so.

00:13:54.918 --> 00:13:57.296
Uruz 7 to all units.

00:13:57.296 --> 00:14:01.300
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Leave the rest to me.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.427
The Arbalest?

00:14:03.427 --> 00:14:05.179
It just activated, didn't it?

00:14:05.179 --> 00:14:08.599
Affirmative. The Lambda Driver
is confirmed activated.

00:14:08.599 --> 00:14:10.184
Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn't.

00:14:10.184 --> 00:14:11.852
What a haphazard piece of equipment.

00:14:11.852 --> 00:14:13.937
I think so as well.

00:14:13.937 --> 00:14:16.523
It seems like you're better
at making jokes than I am.

00:14:16.523 --> 00:14:17.441
Affirmative.

00:14:17.441 --> 00:14:19.318
And wry comments, too.

00:14:19.318 --> 00:14:23.197
--Perth 1 to Uruz 7. Are you back to yourself now?
--Affirmative.

00:14:23.197 --> 00:14:24.531
Then do as you wish.

00:14:24.531 --> 00:14:25.407
Roger.

00:14:31.121 --> 00:14:32.915
Five Venom machines.

00:14:32.915 --> 00:14:35.209
Normally, I would probably be
running away right about now.

00:14:35.209 --> 00:14:37.294
No, we can defeat them, Sergeant.

00:14:37.294 --> 00:14:38.670
That's right! Let's go!

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:39.671
Roger.

00:14:46.178 --> 00:14:47.554
We'll start off with the first machine...

00:14:58.857 --> 00:15:00.859
Spread out!

00:15:00.859 --> 00:15:02.819
You piece of shit!

00:15:10.661 --> 00:15:11.662
Wha--?!

00:15:12.621 --> 00:15:14.540
No way! That's impossible!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:18.627
Two down!

00:15:18.627 --> 00:15:21.004
Warning: enemy approaching.

00:15:21.004 --> 00:15:23.924
Useless piece of junk!

00:15:30.514 --> 00:15:31.682
That makes three.

00:15:31.682 --> 00:15:33.183
Don't steal my line!

00:15:35.394 --> 00:15:37.187
Dammit!

00:15:53.579 --> 00:15:54.621
--Four down!
--Four down!

00:16:02.254 --> 00:16:03.422
This is bad!

00:16:09.052 --> 00:16:10.470
Stay away!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:14.224
Stay away! Stay away!
Stay away! Stay away!

00:16:14.224 --> 00:16:17.603
I'll kill the operator! Don't move!

00:16:17.603 --> 00:16:18.270
Ben!

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:19.730
What the hell is going on here?

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:23.066
I thought Mithril's
Lambda Driver was unstable!

00:16:23.066 --> 00:16:25.861
So how can it be so strong?!

00:16:25.861 --> 00:16:29.865
Bastard... Who in the hell are you?!

00:16:29.865 --> 00:16:33.702
Me? If you want to know, I'll tell you.

00:16:33.702 --> 00:16:35.746
I couldn't care less about Mithril.

00:16:35.746 --> 00:16:41.043
I am from Jindai Tokyo
Municipal High School Class 2-4.

00:16:41.043 --> 00:16:44.129
Hey, hey, I have a hostage here, you know.

00:16:44.129 --> 00:16:46.798
My student number is 41.

00:16:46.798 --> 00:16:48.926
I am in charge of the garbage
and the umbrellas.

00:16:48.926 --> 00:16:51.261
Hello?

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:03.440
My name is Sousuke Sagara!

00:17:14.952 --> 00:17:17.746
Maybe they were just a little too short.

00:17:59.079 --> 00:18:02.666
I did tell you to believe in
your own strength, but still...

00:18:02.666 --> 00:18:04.585
That was overkill, Sergeant.

00:18:04.585 --> 00:18:06.086
My apologies, First Lieutenant.

00:18:09.047 --> 00:18:11.800
All hostile targets destroyed.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.969
Sergeant, I have a question.

00:18:13.969 --> 00:18:15.429
Go ahead.

00:18:15.429 --> 00:18:19.600
The battle we just fought had
a startling outcome in all respects.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:23.103
If possible, could you please
explain the reason?

00:18:23.103 --> 00:18:26.940
The problem got worked out a bit.
I guess that's how it works.

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:28.567
A problem of yours?

00:18:28.567 --> 00:18:31.111
No,<i> our </i>problem.

00:18:31.111 --> 00:18:32.863
Unable to comprehend your response.

00:18:32.863 --> 00:18:35.407
It's something for you
to think about, partner.

00:18:36.742 --> 00:18:41.205
Uruz 7 to all units.
All Venoms have been destroyed.

00:18:41.205 --> 00:18:43.874
I will now return
to the Tuatha de Danaan...

00:18:48.253 --> 00:18:49.421
Correction.

00:18:49.421 --> 00:18:52.174
Uruz 7 will now be
proceeding to his next mission.

00:18:52.174 --> 00:18:54.885
I will leave the Arbalest here.
Retrieve it whenever you wish.

00:18:54.885 --> 00:18:58.555
But if you do not hurry, it will
be confiscated by the local army.

00:18:58.555 --> 00:19:02.017
What are you talking about?
What is your next mission?

00:19:02.017 --> 00:19:05.312
She is waiting. That is all.
End of communication.

00:19:05.312 --> 00:19:08.190
Wait, Sergeant! Are you going
to disobey orders again?

00:19:12.277 --> 00:19:14.446
I don't get it. What's this all about?

00:19:14.446 --> 00:19:16.740
Well, it must be<i> that</i>, right?

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.575
Well, I guess it's okay.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:23.872
It turned out in a way no one had predicted.

00:19:23.872 --> 00:19:27.209
We cannot ignore that machine's potential.

00:19:27.209 --> 00:19:31.338
Yes. She is lending them help.

00:19:31.338 --> 00:19:34.883
Helping that soldier, and that work of art.

00:19:34.883 --> 00:19:36.760
Thank goodness...

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:40.597
It managed to end without
Hong Kong turning into a sea of flames.

00:19:40.597 --> 00:19:42.391
What about Sagara and Chidori?

00:19:42.391 --> 00:19:45.269
Looks like they went back to Tokyo.

00:19:45.269 --> 00:19:47.271
He's disobeying orders.

00:19:47.271 --> 00:19:51.441
Then I suppose you're guilty of
the same crime for bringing her here.

00:19:51.441 --> 00:19:55.195
Well, it's up to the brass to decide.

00:19:55.737 --> 00:19:56.363
"Merida Island"

00:19:56.363 --> 00:20:01.827
I never would have expected you to
defy us in such a threatening manner.

00:20:01.827 --> 00:20:07.040
I have never felt
so angry in my life, Sergeant.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:11.503
General Amit, he is the only one
capable of operating the Arbalest.

00:20:11.503 --> 00:20:12.880
Silence, Captain.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.423
As Chief of Intelligence,

00:20:14.423 --> 00:20:17.342
it is my opinion this man's request
is out of the question.

00:20:18.427 --> 00:20:20.512
General, sir.

00:20:20.512 --> 00:20:24.641
I am only suggesting a change
in the terms of the contract.

00:20:24.641 --> 00:20:26.977
If this is not to your liking,

00:20:26.977 --> 00:20:30.480
I will simply pay the penalty fee for
breaking the contract, and leave this unit.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:33.650
How dare you say such a thing, Sergeant?

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.652
Do you really think that
after turning me into an enemy,

00:20:35.652 --> 00:20:39.740
you'll be able to live
however you please?

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.742
Then I shall ask you something.

00:20:41.742 --> 00:20:46.663
Do you think I am not fully prepared
for what you are implying, General, sir?

00:20:46.663 --> 00:20:48.207
What did you say?

00:20:48.207 --> 00:20:49.833
Listen carefully, General.

00:20:53.086 --> 00:20:56.006
I do not recall going so far
as to sell my soul to Mithril.

00:20:56.006 --> 00:20:59.843
I will stick to my own way
of doing things, that's all.

00:20:59.843 --> 00:21:02.346
I will continue to pilot the Arbalest.

00:21:02.346 --> 00:21:05.849
I will also continue to attend
that school, just like I had been.

00:21:05.849 --> 00:21:07.726
You may even cut my pay
in half if you wish.

00:21:07.726 --> 00:21:09.603
Do you have any complaints about that?

00:21:09.603 --> 00:21:11.855
Watch your mouth, Sergeant!

00:21:11.855 --> 00:21:14.900
Sergeant? I'm just a mercenary.
What do you think you're saying

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:16.568
to someone without any
permanent ties to any one unit?

00:21:16.568 --> 00:21:19.363
Save that kind of line for your pet dogs.

00:21:19.363 --> 00:21:20.280
Why you...

00:21:23.867 --> 00:21:25.536
Lord Mallory?

00:21:25.536 --> 00:21:28.372
You've lost, General.

00:21:28.372 --> 00:21:29.873
An SRT member with highly valuable skills

00:21:29.873 --> 00:21:34.586
is offering to work
for half of his current pay.

00:21:34.586 --> 00:21:37.422
There is nothing for you to be angry about.

00:21:37.422 --> 00:21:39.550
Don't you agree, gentlemen?

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:42.761
Yes, I suppose so.

00:21:42.761 --> 00:21:45.305
Though I couldn't say so publicly.

00:21:47.099 --> 00:21:49.643
Does anyone have any other opinions?

00:21:54.356 --> 00:21:58.151
Then there you have it, Captain Testarossa.

00:21:58.151 --> 00:22:00.320
It must be difficult to handle
all of the subordinates you have,

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:01.321
with their strong personalities.

00:22:01.321 --> 00:22:04.491
No, my subordinates are the best.

00:22:06.368 --> 00:22:08.579
And Sergeant...

00:22:08.579 --> 00:22:11.415
Your name is Sousuke Sagara, correct?

00:22:11.415 --> 00:22:12.791
Yes, sir!

00:22:12.791 --> 00:22:16.503
I will be sure to remember your name.

00:22:16.503 --> 00:22:21.592
This concludes this discussion.
Farewell, gentlemen. Take care.

00:22:30.976 --> 00:22:33.228
I was breaking out
in a cold sweat, Sergeant.

00:22:33.228 --> 00:22:35.772
Please don't add to my stress.

00:22:35.772 --> 00:22:37.983
Yes, sir. My apologies.

00:22:37.983 --> 00:22:39.860
Honestly...

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:41.069
Are you satisfied?

00:22:41.069 --> 00:22:42.112
Yes, sir.

00:22:42.112 --> 00:22:43.780
You look more like a man, now.

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:45.073
Sir?

00:22:45.073 --> 00:22:47.659
I'll treat you to something later.

00:23:05.928 --> 00:23:08.138
I still haven't told you, have I?

00:23:08.138 --> 00:23:09.681
Ma'am?

00:23:09.681 --> 00:23:11.892
I'm sorry about what I said back then.

00:23:11.892 --> 00:23:15.062
No, I'm the one who should be apologizing.

00:23:15.062 --> 00:23:16.855
No, it's okay.

00:23:16.855 --> 00:23:20.400
I forgot my position.

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:23.403
I guess I behaved like a spoiled child.

00:23:24.655 --> 00:23:26.657
But...

00:23:27.991 --> 00:23:29.576
So...

00:23:30.869 --> 00:23:37.042
We're still friends, right?

00:23:37.042 --> 00:23:39.461
Friends?

00:23:48.595 --> 00:23:49.721
Captain.

00:23:49.721 --> 00:23:50.764
Yes?

00:23:50.764 --> 00:23:53.851
If you acknowledge me as a friend,

00:23:53.851 --> 00:23:57.145
would you forgive me for
speaking somewhat bluntly?

00:23:58.188 --> 00:23:59.898
Go ahead.

00:24:04.528 --> 00:24:08.198
Tessa, I'm sorry for everything.

00:24:08.198 --> 00:24:13.579
You are an incredible girl.
To me, you are not just a superior officer.

00:24:13.579 --> 00:24:18.584
I mean, you're more important to me than that.

00:24:18.584 --> 00:24:22.546
If... If something ever happens,
I'll definitely help you.

00:24:22.546 --> 00:24:24.548
Please remember that...

00:24:25.215 --> 00:24:28.635
M-M-M-My apologies!
That was too b-b-blunt after all!

00:24:28.635 --> 00:24:32.097
But it's how I truly feel!
S-S-So long then!

00:24:38.061 --> 00:24:39.813
"Tessa"...

00:24:39.813 --> 00:24:41.231
"Tessa"?!

00:24:41.231 --> 00:24:44.526
He called me "Tessa"! Oh no, what do I do?

00:24:44.526 --> 00:24:47.738
He said I'm "important" to him.
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh!

00:24:47.738 --> 00:24:49.740
"Jindai Tokyo Municipal High School"

00:24:54.328 --> 00:24:56.580
Seriously...

00:24:56.580 --> 00:24:58.415
If you keep doing things like this,

00:24:58.415 --> 00:25:01.001
even I won't be able to cover for you.

00:25:01.001 --> 00:25:02.961
Yes, ma'am! I am very grateful.

00:25:02.961 --> 00:25:04.421
Honestly...

00:25:04.421 --> 00:25:07.257
It's a good thing I kept it in my desk.

00:25:07.257 --> 00:25:09.718
There is that recent incident
with my car, too...

00:25:09.718 --> 00:25:11.053
But at this rate...

00:25:12.095 --> 00:25:12.971
What? What's going on?

00:25:12.971 --> 00:25:14.097
Please don't move!

00:25:14.097 --> 00:25:15.098
There was a laser sight targeted on you.

00:25:15.098 --> 00:25:16.558
--Excuse me!
--There was a laser sight targeted on you.

00:25:16.558 --> 00:25:17.226
--Excuse me!
--What in the world are you talking about?

00:25:17.226 --> 00:25:20.020
Hey, what the hell are you doing Sousuke?

00:25:20.020 --> 00:25:21.563
Get down, Chidori! There's a laser sight...

00:25:21.563 --> 00:25:22.898
"Faculty Room"

00:25:23.649 --> 00:25:25.567
Serves you right.

00:25:25.567 --> 00:25:28.570
I'm the one on surveillance
out here under the cold sky.

00:25:28.570 --> 00:25:30.864
You can at least provide me
with a little amusement.

00:25:34.910 --> 00:25:36.286
It's going to be winter soon...

00:25:36.286 --> 00:25:39.540
Why do you have to cause trouble
the moment you get back here?!

00:25:39.540 --> 00:25:42.376
Do you even take my and the
teacher's support seriously?

00:25:42.376 --> 00:25:43.043
Well, I...

00:25:43.043 --> 00:25:44.461
No excuses!

00:25:44.461 --> 00:25:46.964
You seriously haven't made
any progress whatsoever!

00:25:46.964 --> 00:25:48.966
You always, always, always, always...

00:25:48.966 --> 00:25:52.803
Always, always, always, always...

00:25:52.803 --> 00:25:56.807
Always, always, always...

00:25:59.059 --> 00:26:01.103
So things are...

00:26:02.771 --> 00:26:06.108
back to the way they always were, right?

00:26:06.108 --> 00:26:08.068
Chidori?

00:26:10.320 --> 00:26:15.033
How could you just run away
and leave me here like that...

00:26:15.033 --> 00:26:18.036
What were you thinking?

00:26:18.036 --> 00:26:20.289
I will never forgive you for that.

00:26:20.289 --> 00:26:22.374
I'm sorry.

00:26:22.374 --> 00:26:24.793
"Sorry" isn't going to cut it.

00:26:24.793 --> 00:26:29.965
You jerk. You jerk. You jerk.

00:26:33.218 --> 00:26:36.597
I was scared!

00:26:36.597 --> 00:26:39.224
I was so scared!

00:26:41.143 --> 00:26:45.606
Don't ever do anything like that again!

00:26:45.606 --> 00:26:47.649
You jerk!

00:26:50.485 --> 00:26:55.490
Because I will absolutely never forgive you.

00:27:08.921 --> 00:27:10.339
Huh?

00:27:10.339 --> 00:27:12.382
It's Kana-<i>chan </i>and Sagara.

00:27:12.382 --> 00:27:15.135
What are the two of you doing here?

00:27:15.135 --> 00:27:17.179
To-To-Tokiwa? Oh, we weren't
really doing anything.

00:27:17.179 --> 00:27:21.141
Wait, is Kana-<i>chan </i>crying?

00:27:21.141 --> 00:27:23.018
Yeah. Sousuke, he...

00:27:23.018 --> 00:27:25.854
Sagara! You yelled something about a bomb

00:27:25.854 --> 00:27:27.606
and got rough with
Kana-<i>chan </i>again, didn't you?

00:27:27.606 --> 00:27:28.774
What? No, I...

00:27:28.774 --> 00:27:30.901
It's not very manly to make excuses!

00:27:30.901 --> 00:27:32.069
--Yeah! Yeah!
--Scumbag!

00:27:32.069 --> 00:27:33.153
--You're horrible!
--So lame!

00:27:33.153 --> 00:27:34.696
You're wrong, I just...

00:27:34.696 --> 00:27:36.031
--Just<i> what</i>?
--Just<i> what</i>?

00:27:41.995 --> 00:27:44.289
Well, I guess it's better this way.

00:27:44.289 --> 00:27:45.749
Never mind. No problem.

00:27:45.749 --> 00:27:48.168
--What's that supposed to mean?
--I don't get it!

00:27:48.168 --> 00:27:50.838
--Just hurry up and apologize!
--What are you saying?

00:27:50.838 --> 00:27:53.715
Poor Kana-<i>chan</i>!

00:28:15.779 --> 00:28:17.531
<i>I'm sure you're still looking</i>

00:28:17.531 --> 00:28:21.326
<i>Straight ahead to tomorrow</i>

00:28:21.326 --> 00:28:27.207
<i>Just like you always have</i>

00:28:27.207 --> 00:28:32.921
<i>Just like the sunflowers</i>

00:28:32.921 --> 00:28:39.678
<i>That bloomed on that windy hill</i>

00:28:41.555 --> 00:28:47.477
<i>No matter how far apart we are</i>

00:28:47.477 --> 00:28:53.525
<i>I pray that my singing will reach you</i>

00:28:53.525 --> 00:28:59.573
<i>On nights when the tears never seem to stop</i>

00:28:59.573 --> 00:29:02.910
<i>I want to be the moon</i>

00:29:02.910 --> 00:29:05.913
<i>That shines through your window</i>

00:29:05.913 --> 00:29:13.962
<i>Because I believe we will meet again</i>

00:29:16.298 --> 00:29:19.885
<i>No matter what</i>

00:29:51.834 --> 00:29:53.502
I just remembered something...

00:29:53.502 --> 00:29:56.922
When I saw you in Hong Kong,
you started to tell me something, right?

00:29:56.922 --> 00:29:58.507
What was it?

00:29:58.507 --> 00:30:01.343
Oh, that?

00:30:15.566 --> 00:30:15.816
It was nothing.

00:30:15.816 --> 00:30:17.150
"The Continuing Day by Day"
It was nothing.

00:30:17.150 --> 00:30:19.328
"The Continuing Day by Day"
Oh, I see.
